#: c8f79aa17d004ac6bafaf73e74a36068
msgid "`teleop/mode_state` (`TeleopModeState`)"
msgstr "`teleop/mode_state`（`TeleopModeState`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:204
#: 3b6857f6fab141fcbb1d99fff3726dba
msgid "`VRInputHandler` in `arms_target_manager`"
msgstr "`arms_target_manager` 里的 `VRInputHandler`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:244
#: 6ae8cd123c9f40c2b632e42d6e114599
msgid ""
"Publish on the change topic to request a new mode. Subscribe to the "
"status topic to see the mode that is active now. A dexterous hand, "
"DualHand, or a UI reads `teleop/mode_state` for an event-bus session, or "
"`teleop_mode` when it is following the joystick or the keyboard. "
"`teleop/controller_state` carries the change event. The current mode is "
"the status message."
msgstr ""
"要改模式，往修改话题上发。要看现在处于哪种模式，订反馈话题。灵巧手、DualHand 或界面在事件总线会话里读 "
"`teleop/mode_state`；跟着手柄或键盘时读 `teleop_mode`。`teleop/controller_state` "
"承载的是修改事件。当前模式在反馈消息里。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:246
#: 2df8841bac964ce2830790a44a5b7b61
msgid ""
"The names above are relative. They follow the robot namespace, so two "
"robots in one scene stay apart. With no namespace the event-bus status "
"topic is `/teleop/mode_state`. In namespace `/robot_a` it is "
"`/robot_a/teleop/mode_state`. Subscribe in that same namespace."
msgstr ""
"上面这些名字都是相对话题，落在机器人命名空间里，同一场景两台机器人互不串扰。没有命名空间时，事件总线的反馈话题是 "
"`/teleop/mode_state`。命名空间为 `/robot_a` 时是 "
"`/robot_a/teleop/mode_state`。订阅端放在同一个命名空间。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:248
#: cd0dc3573ef547909e2cab81dc2de689
msgid ""
"Use QoS `Reliable` + `TransientLocal`. The publisher sends one message at"
" startup, then another when a field changes. A node that starts later "
"still receives the last snapshot."
msgstr "QoS 用 `Reliable` + `TransientLocal`。发布端启动时发一次，之后字段变化再发。后启动的节点仍能收到最近一次快照。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:250
#: 1fde294ffefe47538ba525ecc172e8fe
msgid ""
"Definitions: [`TeleopModeState.msg`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/TeleopModeState.msg),"
" [`TeleopMode.msg`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/TeleopMode.msg),"
" and [section 1 of the message README](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)."
msgstr ""
"定义见 [`TeleopModeState.msg`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/TeleopModeState.msg)、[`TeleopMode.msg`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/msg/TeleopMode.msg)，以及[消息"
" README 第 1 节](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/main/command/arms_ros2_control_msgs/README.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:252
#: 86d6210282864588b97c31d8d1be92a8
msgid "Event-bus status (`TeleopModeState`)"
msgstr "事件总线反馈（`TeleopModeState`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:254
#: 882fac6bf27d4e91a58d140ff7cd6afb
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`TeleopModeState` is the latch for the event bus. `TeleopMode` is a "
"different message, for the joystick and the keyboard. Body lock and "
"whether WBC has an arm enabled stay on {ref}`wbc-current-state` "
"(`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`)."
msgstr ""
"`TeleopModeState` 是事件总线的锁存。`TeleopMode` 是另一条消息，给手柄和键盘用。身体锁定、以及 WBC "
"里某条臂是否使能，仍看 {ref}`wbc-current-"
"state`（`/ocs2_wbc_controller/current_state`）。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:256
#: 10c1206f30cc4cf2b0802e3f83d1bcca
msgid ""
"`left_arm_paused` and `right_arm_paused` are that arm’s teleop pause. "
"They stand apart from `left_arm_state` / `right_arm_state`: an arm can be"
" VR-paused and still be `ARM_ENABLED`. On 全身, `yb_pause_semantics` "
"reports which meaning left **Y** / right **B** currently have. `false` is"
" WBC single-arm disable (停单臂). `true` is teleop pause (停发指令). The buttons"
" that flip the latch are in [Stop one arm vs stop sending VR commands"
"](#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands)."
msgstr ""
"`left_arm_paused` 和 `right_arm_paused` 是该臂的遥操暂停，与 `left_arm_state` / "
"`right_arm_state` 分开：一条臂可以处于 VR 暂停，同时仍是 "
"`ARM_ENABLED`。全身下，`yb_pause_semantics` 报告左 **Y** / 右 **B** "
"当前是哪种含义。`false` 是 WBC 单臂禁用（停单臂）。`true` 是遥操暂停（停发指令）。翻转这把锁存的按键见 [停单臂与停发指令"
"](#stop-one-arm-vs-stop-sending-vr-commands)。"

