msgid ""
"Subscribe to `teleop/mode_state` in the robot namespace. Read "
"`mirror_movement` for mirror. Read pause, the gripper-mode flags, "
"`update_mode`, and `topology` when the hand or the UI needs them. "
"Open/close and percent commands stay on `*/target_command` and "
"`*/target_percent`."
msgstr ""
"在机器人命名空间下订阅 `teleop/mode_state`。镜像读 "
"`mirror_movement`。手或界面需要时再读暂停、夹爪模式、`update_mode` 和 `topology`。开合与比例命令仍走 "
"`*/target_command` 和 `*/target_percent`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: a952d8bd8af049a59f6064b9067d04c4
msgid "ros2 topic echo /robot_a/teleop/mode_state"
msgstr "ros2 topic echo /robot_a/teleop/mode_state"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:280
#: a37cfc8a243a423498eafeb68e7da6f9
msgid ""
"With an empty namespace, echo `/teleop/mode_state`. Match QoS `Reliable` "
"+ `TransientLocal` on the subscription."
msgstr "没有命名空间时，查看 `/teleop/mode_state`。订阅 QoS 用 `Reliable` + `TransientLocal`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:282
#: 9cf053671bc743709891186cfd881536
msgid "Joystick and keyboard status (`TeleopMode`)"
msgstr "手柄与键盘反馈（`TeleopMode`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:284
#: 481465c8b69844758a966c6f425b510b
msgid ""
"`TeleopMode` on `teleop_mode` is the latch for the joystick and the "
"keyboard. It uses the same QoS, and the same rule: once at startup, again"
" when a field changes. The active arm is `Inputs.target` on "
"`control_input` (`1` left, `2` right), not a field of `TeleopMode`. In "
"chassis mode the joystick may pause the periodic `Inputs` stream, so keep"
" the last `target`. Fields and the enable switch: [Joystick "
"teleop](9-joystick_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"`teleop_mode` 上的 `TeleopMode` 是手柄和键盘的锁存。QoS 相同，规则也相同：启动发一次，字段变化再发。当前臂是 "
"`control_input` 上的 `Inputs.target`（`1` 左，`2` 右），不是 `TeleopMode` "
"的字段。底盘模式下手柄可能暂停周期 `Inputs`，请保留最近一次 `target`。字段和启用开关见 "
"[手柄遥操作](9-joystick_teleop.md)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:286
#: 62afc136acc94c75b9e31a38f04682aa
msgid "When VR moves the arm and the gripper"
msgstr "VR 何时推动手臂和夹爪"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:288
#: b268e454b3ea44e886801394129b91f1
msgid "VR end-effector targets and VR gripper output follow `update_mode`."
msgstr "VR 的末端目标和 VR 夹爪输出跟随 `update_mode`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: 0abfdb732e43428895ea6d93d5140ec9
msgid "HUD"
msgstr "HUD"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: cdff903896d6442fa8d9804a3983c355
msgid "What VR publishes"
msgstr "VR 发布什么"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: e4ef5a402285453fb6b703336c1d4b53
msgid "`true` (UPDATE)"
msgstr "`true`（UPDATE）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: 883e9d35bbb045048bb5c8370092dd2f
msgid "`TELEOP ON`"
msgstr "`TELEOP ON`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: 17ad100a2551474a97187089668481ef
msgid ""
"End-effector targets from the controller pose, and trigger gripper "
"commands"
msgstr "由手柄位姿得到的末端目标，以及扳机夹爪命令"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: 524c5362a022408ca112f048727a32c5
msgid "`false` (STORAGE)"
msgstr "`false`（STORAGE）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: 2eb1b8bf0da944d98b83e6859f1294e8
msgid "`TELEOP OFF`"
msgstr "`TELEOP OFF`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: 28d334b32204400ea0eb413cb9f54152
msgid ""
"No arm targets and no VR gripper commands. The latest VR pose stays "
"cached for the next UPDATE."
msgstr "不发臂目标，也不发 VR 夹爪命令。最近一次 VR 位姿会留下，供下次进入 UPDATE 时对齐。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:295
#: 6fff5b52db294380adec7b847b7c989f
msgid ""
"Right stick click toggles the two, and only while FSM is **OCS2**. In "
"STORAGE, joystick and keyboard `hand_command` on `control_input` still "
"open and close the hand. While UPDATE is on, the VR trigger stream keeps "
"writing the gripper; leave UPDATE when the joystick should own the hand."
msgstr ""
"点右摇杆在两者之间切换，且仅在 FSM 为 **OCS2** 时可以。STORAGE 下，手柄和键盘经 `control_input` 的 "
"`hand_command` 仍能开合手。UPDATE 打开时，VR 扳机流会持续写夹爪；要让手柄独占手，先退出 UPDATE。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:297
#: 9a24e685347f41d089d091203d59e4c7
msgid "RViz teleop HUD"
msgstr "RViz 遥操状态叠加层"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:299
#: f366409198f74299b9899ddd5c6feb60
msgid ""
"`arms_rviz_control_plugin/TeleopModeDisplay` is one RViz display with two"
" cards, stacked at the top left of the 3D view. If only one path is "
"active, that card fills the top slot. Add it from Displays → Add → "
"TeleopModeDisplay. `Scale` runs from 0.5 to 2.0. A card stays hidden "
"until its message arrives, and while that path is inactive. The display "
"runs in any FSM state. Put RViz in the same namespace as "
"`arms_target_manager`."
msgstr ""
"`arms_rviz_control_plugin/TeleopModeDisplay` 是一个 RViz "
"显示项，在三维视图左上角叠两张卡片。只有一条路径在用时，那张卡片补到最上。从 Displays → Add → TeleopModeDisplay"
" 添加。`Scale` 为 0.5 到 2.0。对应消息还没到，或该路径未激活时，卡片隐藏。任何 FSM 状态下都会画。把 RViz 放在与 "
"`arms_target_manager` 相同的命名空间。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: 374f9ead8fd74950a8d2a94169d98b0f
msgid "Card"
msgstr "卡片"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: 5e414144977f49a4bc9181fe8d2a44e1
msgid "Visible when"
msgstr "何时显示"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: af523e167b844663b5a84f0c2626857d
msgid "What it reads"
msgstr "读什么"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: d98930e47a9e445298eb6e53ee71dbe8
msgid "`teleop/mode_state.enabled` is true"
msgstr "`teleop/mode_state.enabled` 为 true"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: ab7b5d4e311f44c5b9d2b08fa4f98cee
msgid "`teleop/mode_state`"
msgstr "`teleop/mode_state`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: 873cbb59bc6648e699f0a16dc329fb4c
msgid "Control input (joystick / keyboard)"
msgstr "控制输入（手柄 / 键盘）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: 9b5993a0f6944cab99dac82f060718be
msgid "`teleop_mode.active` is true"
msgstr "`teleop_mode.active` 为 true"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:276
#: c145711140344027882f552c68835467
msgid "`teleop_mode`, and `control_input` for the active arm"
msgstr "`teleop_mode`，以及当前臂用的 `control_input`"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:306
#: 24dc1158eaa04d878f05188fa6a63bca
msgid ""
"The event-bus card shows `TELEOP` `ON`/`OFF`, `MIRROR`, and `L`/`R` as "
"`RUN` or `PAUSE`, plus the stick plane, chassis, and gripper mode for the"
" current route. A click publishes the same `teleop/controller_state` "
"events as the headset: `4` toggles UPDATE, `7` toggles mirror, and "
"`L`/`R` match left **Y** / right **B**. On 全身, when `yb_pause_semantics` "
"is still false, `L`/`R` send event `16` first, wait until the latch "
"flips, then send `3` or `6`. The control-input card is read-only: active "
"arm `L`/`R` or `CHASSIS`, mirror, and speed `HIGH`/`LOW`. A joystick-only"
" view of that card is in [Joystick teleop](9-joystick_teleop.md#control-"
"input-hud)."
msgstr ""
"事件总线卡片显示 `TELEOP` 的 `ON`/`OFF`、`MIRROR`，以及 `L`/`R` 的 `RUN` 或 "
"`PAUSE`，并随当前路由显示摇杆平面、底盘和夹爪模式。点击会向 `teleop/controller_state` 发与头显相同的事件：`4`"
" 切换 UPDATE，`7` 切换镜像，`L`/`R` 与左 **Y** / 右 **B** 相同。全身下，若 "
"`yb_pause_semantics` 仍为 false，`L`/`R` 先发事件 `16`，等到锁存翻转后再发 `3` 或 "
"`6`。控制输入卡片只读：当前臂 `L`/`R` 或 `CHASSIS`，镜像，以及速度 `HIGH`/`LOW`。只开手柄时的这张卡片见 "
"[手柄遥操作](9-joystick_teleop.md#control-input-hud)。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:308
#: d122a07249d64ce9ad44ecac1d99e1d3
msgid ""
"The clip below shows the event-bus card alone: only the active path fills"
" the top-left slot. Read it as `TeleopModeState`. `TELEOP ON` is "
"`update_mode` true (UPDATE) and is green; `TELEOP OFF` is STORAGE. "
"`L`/`R` `RUN` means that arm is following; `PAUSE` is `left_arm_paused` "
"or `right_arm_paused`, in magenta, with `RUN` in green. `STICK XY` is the"
" arm stick plane. `WAIST XY` and `WAIST ZYAW` replace those labels while "
"the body mode is 跟随. `GRIP %` is percent mode; `GRIP SW` is open/close."
msgstr ""
"下面这段只显示事件总线卡片：左上角只留给当前通路。把它读成 `TeleopModeState`。`TELEOP ON` 是 "
"`update_mode` 为 true（UPDATE），绿色；`TELEOP OFF` 是 STORAGE。`L`/`R` 的 `RUN` "
"表示该臂在跟随；`PAUSE` 是 `left_arm_paused` 或 `right_arm_paused`，品红色，`RUN` "
"为绿色。`STICK XY` 是臂摇杆平面。身体模式为跟随时，这些标签换成 `WAIST XY` 和 `WAIST ZYAW`。`GRIP %` "
"是比例模式，`GRIP SW` 是开合模式。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:310
#: f846f057ba1a41629cea461a93c994df
msgid ""
"`MIRROR` stays `OFF` for the whole clip. The card moves from TELEOP off "
"with both arms running, to TELEOP on, through a one-arm pause, then to "
"the waist labels. `GRIP` flips from `%` to `SW` and back; while it shows "
"`SW`, the gripper panel’s buttons read Close."
msgstr ""
"整段里 `MIRROR` 一直是 `OFF`。卡片从 TELEOP 关闭、双臂 RUN，到 TELEOP 打开，经过单臂 "
"PAUSE，再切到腰部标签。`GRIP` 在 `%` 和 `SW` 之间来回切换；显示 `SW` 时，夹爪面板上的按钮为 `Close`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md:312
