#~ msgid ""
#~ "The event-bus card shows `TELEOP` "
#~ "`ON`/`OFF`, `MIRROR`, and `L`/`R` as "
#~ "`RUN` or `PAUSE`, plus the stick "
#~ "plane, chassis, and gripper mode for "
#~ "the current route. A click publishes "
#~ "the same `teleop/controller_state` events as"
#~ " the headset: `4` toggles UPDATE, `7`"
#~ " toggles mirror, and `L`/`R` match "
#~ "left **Y** / right **B**. On 全身,"
#~ " when `yb_pause_semantics` is still false,"
#~ " `L`/`R` send event `16` first, wait"
#~ " until the latch flips, then send "
#~ "`3` or `6`. The control-input card"
#~ " is read-only: active arm `L`/`R` "
#~ "or `CHASSIS`, mirror, and speed "
#~ "`HIGH`/`LOW`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "事件总线卡片显示 `TELEOP` 的 `ON`/`OFF`、`MIRROR`，以及 "
#~ "`L`/`R` 的 `RUN` 或 "
#~ "`PAUSE`，并随当前路由显示摇杆平面、底盘和夹爪模式。点击会向 `teleop/controller_state` "
#~ "发与头显相同的事件：`4` 切换 UPDATE，`7` 切换镜像，`L`/`R` 与左"
#~ " **Y** / 右 **B** 相同。全身下，若 "
#~ "`yb_pause_semantics` 仍为 false，`L`/`R` 先发事件 "
#~ "`16`，等到锁存翻转后再发 `3` 或 `6`。控制输入卡片只读：当前臂 `L`/`R`"
#~ " 或 `CHASSIS`，镜像，以及速度 `HIGH`/`LOW`。"

